      ['Autophagy','Delivery of the cell\'s own material for breakdown. An autophagosome is a membrane-enclosed carrier that can bring this material to a lysosomal route.'],
      ['Oxidation and peroxide','Oxidation removes electrons, negatively charged particles, from a substance. Some peroxisomal reactions produce hydrogen peroxide, H2O2, a reactive compound that can damage cells if too much accumulates.'],
      ['Peroxisome','An organelle with oxidative metabolic reactions and enzymes that manage hydrogen peroxide.'],
      ['Catalase','An enzyme that can break hydrogen peroxide down into water and oxygen.'],
      ['Lytic vacuole','A plant membrane-enclosed compartment that can use acidic hydrolytic breakdown to recycle material.']
